    {
      "fileName": "dragon-roar.json",
      "id": "SELSj1vvVLx5cP72",
      "name": "Dragon Roar",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "SELSj1vvVLx5cP72",
        "folder": "5fWVGjsONPZTddWC",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Dragon Roar",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dragon Stance]</p><hr /><p>You bellow, instilling fear in your enemies. Enemies within a @Template[emanation|distance:15] must succeed at a @Check[will|against:intimidation|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened] save against your Intimidation DC or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure). When a creature frightened by the roar begins its turn adjacent to you, it can't reduce its frightened value below 1 on that turn.</p>\n<p>Your first attack that hits a frightened creature after you roar and before the end of your next turn gains a +4 circumstance bonus to damage.</p>\n<p>After you use Dragon Roar, you can't use it again for [[/r 1d4 #Recharge Dragon Roar]]{1d4 rounds}. Its effects end immediately if you leave Dragon Stance. Creatures in the area are then temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Dragon Stance"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "disabledIf": [
                {
                  "not": "self:effect:dragon-stance"
                }
              ],
              "disabledValue": false,
              "key": "RollOption",
