          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're in @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Rushing Goat Stance].</p><hr /><p>You rush into your enemies with great and reckless force. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Climb], Stride, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Leap], then make a ramming horn Strike. On a success, the target of the Strike is pushed up to 10 feet directly away from you. On a critical success, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>"
          },
